// A gallery of shader graphs, each on its own pedestal, left to right: a
// hologram, a dissolve, cel shading, hammered gold (the Specular
// workflow), pixel art, rock from three sides, graded marble. Behind
// them a banner waved by its graph's vertex stage and more rock; in
// front a pool whose water reads the scene under it and its depth, a
// fountain of cooling sparks in it. Fireflies over everything, sparks
// in frames of a picture at the end of the row, and the whole picture
// through a fullscreen graph (core/film.post.ron): distance haze,
// darkened corners, grain. Each graph lies beside its material in its
// feature's folder; `scrap check` builds them all.
(
    view: (position: (0.0, 3.6, 11.0), target: (0.0, 1.1, 0.5), fov_deg: 52.0),
    sun: (hour: 17.6, intensity: 0.9),
    post: (bloom: (intensity: 0.6)),
    fullscreen: (graph: "film", params: [0.6, 0.55, 0.6, 0.72]),
    entities: [
